They are not the contract and they do not replace the numbered requirements:
they are what a requirement is allowed to be satisfied by. A change that meets
every requirement and breaks one of these is a regression, and it is the
regression this loop keeps shipping. Check the diff against every line before
you hand back, including the lines this round's findings never mention.
